title: The new shape of ​CSQP
view-if: cecp_formation_trigger and next_election_time - time <= 3
face-image: img/events/cecp_formation.png
tags: event
new-page: true
max-visits: 1
on-arrival: {!
    Q.cecp_podemos_confederal = Q.podemos_ideology.includes('Confederalism');
    var autonomyRatio = Q.cecp_podemos_confederal ? 0.6 : Q.podemos_ideology.includes(', Federalism') ? 0.7 : 0.8;
    var valid = 0, allied = 0;
    for (var c of Q.parlament_constituencies) {
        for (var d of Q.parlament_demographics) {
            var weight = Q['parlament_' + c + '_' + d + '_pop'] || 0;
            for (var p of Q.parties) {
                if (p == 'abstain') continue;
                var votes = weight * (Q[p + '_parlament_' + c + '_' + d + '_support'] || 0);
                valid += votes;
                if (p == 'csqp') allied += votes;
            }
        }
    }
    var congresoValid = Q.congreso_parties_catalunya.reduce((sum, p) => sum + (Q[p + '_congreso_catalunya_support'] || 0), 0);
    var nationalLeft = (Q.podemos_congreso_catalunya_support || 0) + (Q.up_congreso_catalunya_support || 0);
    var congresoShare = congresoValid > 0 ? 100 * nationalLeft / congresoValid : 0;
    var allyShare = valid > 0 ? 100 * allied / valid : 0;
    var localValid = Q.parties_bcn.reduce((sum, p) => sum + (Q[p + '_local_barcelona_support'] || 0), 0);
    var bcomuShare = localValid > 0 ? 100 * (Q.bcomu_local_barcelona_support || 0) / localValid : 0;
    Q.cecp_autonomy_credible = allyShare >= Math.max(5, congresoShare * autonomyRatio);
    Q.cecp_asens_base_credible = bcomuShare >= Math.max(5, congresoShare * autonomyRatio);
    Q.cecp_podemos_sorpasso = (Q.podemos_congreso_s || 0) + (Q.up_congreso_s || 0) > (Q.psoe_congreso_s || 0);
    Q.cecp_oliveres_cost = Q.cecp_podemos_confederal && Q.podemos_ideology.includes('Left Social Democracy') ? 1 : 0;
    Q.cecp_asens_cost = !Q.cecp_podemos_confederal && !Q.cecp_autonomy_credible ? 1 : 0;

    Q.cecp_formed = true;
    Q.parlament_current_icv = "cecp";
    Q.cecp_parlament_s = Q.csqp_parlament_s;
    Q.cecp_parlament_pv = Q.csqp_parlament_pv;
    Q.csqp_parlament_s = 0;
    Q.csqp_parlament_pv = 0;

    Q.cecp_relations = Q.csqp_relations;
    Q.cecp_leader = "???";
    Q.cecp_leader_gender = "f";
    G.setText(Q, "cecp_ideology", G.text("Left Social Democracy, Federalism"));

    for(var prov of Q.parlament_constituencies){
        for(var demo of Q.parlament_demographics){
            Q["abstain_parlament_" + prov + "_" + demo + "_support"] += Q["csqp_parlament_" + prov + "_" + demo + "_support"] * 0.05;
            Q["cecp_parlament_" + prov + "_" + demo + "_support"] = Q["csqp_parlament_" + prov + "_" + demo + "_support"] * 0.95;
            Q["csqp_parlament_" + prov + "_" + demo + "_support"] = 0;
        }
    }


    // governing stuff
    if  (Q.president_party == "csqp") {
        Q.president_party = "cecp";
    }

    if (Q.vicepresident_party == "csqp") {
        Q.vicepresident_party = "cecp"
    }

    if (Q.economy_minister_party == "csqp") {
        Q.economy_minister_party = "cecp";
    }

    if (Q.interior_minister_party == "csqp") {
        Q.interior_minister_party = "cecp";
    }

    if (Q.health_minister_party == "csqp") {
        Q.health_minister_party = "cecp";
    }

    if (Q.education_minister_party == "csqp") {
        Q.education_minister_party = "cecp";
    }

    if (Q.territory_minister_party == "csqp") {
        Q.territory_minister_party = "cecp";
    }

    if (Q.foreign_minister_party == "csqp") {
        Q.foreign_minister_party = "cecp";
    }

    if (Q.bnl_minister_party == "csqp") {
        Q.bnl_minister_party = "cecp";
    }

    if (Q.speaker_party == "csqp") {
        Q.speaker_party = "cecp";
    }

    if (Q.cat_coalition.includes("csqp")) {
        Q.cat_coalition = Q.cat_coalition.map(item => item === "csqp" ? "cecp" : item);
        G.updateText(Q, "cat_coalition_disp", function (recipe) {
            return G.rebrandGovernmentText(G.rebrandGovernmentText(recipe, "CSQP", "CECP", true), "csqp", "cecp", true);
        });
    }

    Q.ecp_formation_countdown = 12;
    if (!Q.countdowns.includes("ecp_formation")) Q.countdowns.push("ecp_formation");   
!}

= The new shape of ​CSQP

After now quite some time operating in the Parlament, CSQP is hardly what it once was. The newly-born Podemos and bcomu were teaming up with a bleeding ICV-EUiA. But these are no toddlers anymore. With a more formed party structure, they are now trying to bet on a more permanent electoral coalition and a new form for the Catalan plurinational left: CECP. 

[? if csqp_leader == "Arcadi Oliveres": Arcadi Oliveres will try his best to keep the ship he captains together, but its unclear if his coalition partners are eager enough to keep his powers within the executive. ?][? if csqp_leader != "Arcadi Oliveres": CSQP figurehead Lluís Rabell will hardly seek re-election for a post he never really wanted. ?]There are different names being debated for a new leadership.

- @arcadi_keeps
- @domenech_leads
- @coscubiela_leads
- @asens_leads

@arcadi_keeps
title: Arcadi Oliveres keeps the leadership
view-if: csqp_leader == "Arcadi Oliveres"
choose-if: {! return Q.cecp_autonomy_credible && (Q.cecp_podemos_confederal || !Q.cecp_podemos_sorpasso) && (Q.cecp_oliveres_cost == 0 || (Q.cecp_relations >= 55 && Q.party_resources >= Q.cecp_oliveres_cost)); !}
subtitle: [? if cecp_oliveres_cost = 1: He'll need a bit of a push to do that, given the direction Podemos is taking. \[-1 resources\] ?]
unavailable-subtitle: [? if not cecp_autonomy_credible or (not cecp_podemos_confederal and cecp_podemos_sorpasso): Podemos enjoys too much momentum at the moment for him to keep his position. ?][? if cecp_oliveres_cost = 1: [? if cecp_relations < 55: We don't have good enough relations with CSQP (now CECP). ?][? if party_resources < 1: Not enough resources.?] ?]
on-arrival: {!
    if (Q.parlament_current_icv == 'cecp' && Q.cecp_leader == '???' && Q.csqp_leader == 'Arcadi Oliveres'
        && Q.cecp_autonomy_credible && (Q.cecp_podemos_confederal || !Q.cecp_podemos_sorpasso)
        && (Q.cecp_oliveres_cost == 0 || (Q.cecp_relations >= 55 && Q.party_resources >= Q.cecp_oliveres_cost))) {
        Q.party_resources -= Q.cecp_oliveres_cost;
        Q.cecp_leader = "Arcadi Oliveres";
        Q.cecp_leader_gender = "m";
        G.setText(Q, "cecp_ideology", G.text("Anticapitalism, Plurinationalism"));
    }
!}

Despite somewhat challenging odds, Arcadi Oliveres seems to have managed to renew his leadership, now at the forefront of the new CECP brand. Despite having had to give some concessions to the forming parties, the new coalition looks like it will maintain the spirit of the streets.

- @post_event: Let's hope to see more of him!

@domenech_leads
title: Xavier Domènech wins the leadership
subtitle: Not a very surprising outcome.
on-arrival: {!
    if (Q.parlament_current_icv == 'cecp' && Q.cecp_leader == '???') {
        Q.cecp_leader = "Xavier Domènech";
        Q.cecp_leader_gender = "m";
        G.setText(Q, "cecp_ideology", G.text("Anti-austerity Left, Federalism"));
    }
!}

Not very surprisingly, the hardly controversial figure of Xavier Domènech has been able to secure the support of all groups and parties that make up CECP. While more moderate, at least he seems to conserve a bit o the federalist spirit that CSQP embodied...

- @post_event: We'll have to see how that goes.

@coscubiela_leads
title: Joan Coscubiela wins the leadership
view-if: csqp_leader != "Arcadi Oliveres"
choose-if: {! return !Q.cecp_podemos_confederal && !Q.cecp_autonomy_credible && Q.cecp_podemos_sorpasso; !}
unavailable-subtitle: The most conservative forces in ICV-EUiA and Podemos lack the strength to make this happen.
on-arrival: {!
    if (Q.parlament_current_icv == 'cecp' && Q.cecp_leader == '???' && Q.csqp_leader != 'Arcadi Oliveres'
        && !Q.cecp_podemos_confederal && !Q.cecp_autonomy_credible && Q.cecp_podemos_sorpasso) {
        Q.cecp_leader = "Joan Coscubiela";
        Q.cecp_leader_gender = "m";
        G.setText(Q, "cecp_ideology", G.text("Social Democracy, Federalism"));
    }
!}

Somehow, the other forces in the CECP coalition have not been able to stop the most conservative forces in the old ICV-EUiA. Unexpectedly, Joan Coscubiela will take the helm after all...

- @post_event: There's no way this is good...

@asens_leads
title: Jaume Asens wins the leadership
choose-if: {! return Q.cecp_asens_base_credible && (Q.cecp_podemos_confederal || (Q.local_barcelona_wp == 'bcomu' && !Q.cecp_podemos_sorpasso)) && (Q.cecp_asens_cost == 0 || (Q.cecp_relations >= 55 && Q.party_resources >= Q.cecp_asens_cost)); !}
subtitle: [? if cecp_asens_cost = 1: He'll need a bit of a push to do that, given the momentum Podemos enjoys at the moment. \[-1 resources\] ?]
unavailable-subtitle: [? if cecp_asens_cost = 1: [? if cecp_relations < 55: We don't have good enough relations with CSQP (now CECP). ?][? if party_resources < 1: Not enough resources.?] ?][? if not cecp_asens_base_credible or (not cecp_podemos_confederal and (local_barcelona_wp != "bcomu" or cecp_podemos_sorpasso)): BComu does not have a strong enough position. ?]
on-arrival: {!
    if (Q.parlament_current_icv == 'cecp' && Q.cecp_leader == '???' && Q.cecp_asens_base_credible
        && (Q.cecp_podemos_confederal || (Q.local_barcelona_wp == 'bcomu' && !Q.cecp_podemos_sorpasso))
        && (Q.cecp_asens_cost == 0 || (Q.cecp_relations >= 55 && Q.party_resources >= Q.cecp_asens_cost))) {
        Q.party_resources -= Q.cecp_asens_cost;
        Q.cecp_leader = "Jaume Asens";
        Q.cecp_leader_gender = "m";
        G.setText(Q, "cecp_ideology", G.text("Anti-austerity left, Plurinationalism"));
    }
!}

From the street protests of Barcelona, to the town hall with BComu and Ada Colau, now Jaume Asens will take the reigns of a renewed CECP. At least he seems to conserve a bit o the federalist spirit that CSQP embodied...

- @post_event: We'll have to see how that goes.
